  "p(t, n) = p0 * (1 - k)^(t - n/r)            (t in days = seconds / 86400, n = DP units sold so far)",
  "unit j of a purchase costs p(t, n + j), j = 0..q-1 (spec convention; Art Gobblers uses sold + 1)",
